comment "Mediatek media platform drivers"

config VIDEO_MT6797_CODEC_LAB
	tristate "MT6797 BSP codec algorithm resource bridge"
	depends on ARCH_MEDIATEK && MTK_IOMMU && COMPAT
	help
	  Root-only bring-up bridge for the MT6797 BSP algorithm libraries.
	  Provides bounded DMA, M4U, clock, power and IRQ access per engine.

